# rustc's dependency (format `<path> <name>`, path relative to this dir): the
# runner pool its `finish` step curries every built binary onto. It is DECLARED
# here rather than passed by each caller — a tool says what it is building, not
# what base the result rides. rustc is SEEDED, so bootstrap realizes this dep by
# binding the same runner into the seed result as a hash literal (`--runner`),
# the way it already does for `--cargo`; when rustc stops being seeded the
# expression will bind DEEP-DEPS/runner directly.
../runner runner
